Done = decide whether nfd-worker gets its own probe, or whether the NFD probe reads both objects. Either way, status, the dry run and apply then agree on it, as k350/k351 made them agree for the other GPU workloads (OCP::Drift->version_against_pin, Workloads::off_pin). Test: hand-change the nfd-worker image in a fake cluster; status names it, the dry run says it would re-apply, and the real run re-applies. Red first, then a mutation check.

Lanes: ocp-state-worker (the probe in OCP::Drift), then ocp-apply-worker if setup_nfd needs to read the second object.
